    "SKILL.md": {
      "upstream_sha256": "1e1ece380ad7e2a309196088886959e063b3d5e01a9188eae2a730615e917b84",
      "local_sha256": "1f2eb368790f84142b13b518e4844265882c940fc89b4658ac4e30e285054868",
      "status": "adapted",
      "upstream_fields": {
        "description": "description: 做 PPT 和美化 PPT 的一站式 skill，输出可编辑的原生 .pptx。从零生成时，给一个题目、一篇文章或口播稿、一份大纲，产出结论式标题、带口播备注、风格统一的 PPT；按参考图美化时，给一份朴素的 .pptx 和一张参考图，文字一字不改地换上统一的配色、母版、版式、图标和插画。当用户说\"做个PPT\"\"把这篇文章做成PPT\"\"生成口播PPT\"\"美化PPT\"\"照这张图的风格改PPT\"\"套个风格\"\"make slides\"\"beautify my deck\"，或丢来 pptx、文章、大纲时，务必使用此skill。生图模型可配置，没配置时自动用程序化插画兜底。\n"
      },
      "reason": [
        "Preserve the full upstream description and dispatch_intent verbatim, and retain every original when_to_use phrase, order and separator. Insert separately identified local trigger items at existing list boundaries only; keep Chinese display text in metadata.zh_description. For fields absent upstream, retain the explicitly local values. Preserve local license/version and frozen policy."
      ],
